{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Manual Integration"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/manualintegration"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/ManualIntegration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Download the SDK","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Download-the-SDK"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework","│   ├── CardSessions.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCommon.xcframework","│   └── AdyenCardReveal.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"syntax":"text","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Required Frameworks","anchor":"Required-Frameworks","type":"heading"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Network Token Provisioning (Sessions Approach)","anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning-Sessions-Approach"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All of the following frameworks are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"required"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for the sessions-based provisioning:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Framework","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Purpose","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Import in Code?","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Session-based provisioning logic and public API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shared types (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":", etc.)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCore.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Internal secure communication"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}],"type":"strong"}]}]]]},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"IssuingCore.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must be embedded in your app for the SDK to function, but you should "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" import it in your code. It is used internally by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardProvisioningSessions"},{"type":"text","text":" and should not be accessed directly."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Network Token Provisioning (Manual Approach)","type":"heading","anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning-Manual-Approach"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you prefer direct control over the provisioning flow, use these frameworks instead:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Framework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purpose"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import in Code?"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardProvisioning.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Manual provisioning logic and public API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wallet extension provisioning (extension target only)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The manual approach does not require ","type":"text"},{"code":"IssuingCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon"},{"text":". It is a standalone integration that communicates with your backend directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"anchor":"Card-Sessions-PANPIN-Reveal-PIN-Change","type":"heading","text":"Card Sessions (PAN\/PIN Reveal, PIN Change)","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following frameworks are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"required"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for card reveal operations:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Framework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purpose"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import in Code?"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardSessions.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card reveal logic and public API"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared types ("},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", etc.)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCore.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Internal secure communication","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenCardReveal.xcframework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cryptographic card reveal operations"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}],"type":"strong"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenCardReveal.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" must be embedded but should "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" be imported directly."}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Embed-the-Frameworks","text":"Embed the Frameworks"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Drag all four "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" bundles into your Xcode project navigator."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select your app target, go to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"General > Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure all frameworks are listed and set to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Embed & Sign"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". Include only the frameworks for the features you use:"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sessions approach (provisioning):"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCore.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Embed & Sign","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Manual approach (provisioning):"}]}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"CardProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Embed & Sign","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign (extension target only)"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions (PAN\/PIN reveal):"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardSessions.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenCardReveal.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Import-Statements","type":"heading","text":"Import Statements","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import the modules you need:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import CardProvisioningSessions  \/\/ Sessions-based provisioning","import CardProvisioning          \/\/ Manual provisioning (alternative to sessions)","import CardProvisioningExtension \/\/ Wallet extension (manual approach)","import CardSessions              \/\/ PAN\/PIN reveal, PIN change","import IssuingCommon             \/\/ Shared types (TokenProviding, etc.)"]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You do not need all imports. Use only the modules relevant to your chosen approach."}]}],"name":"Note","style":"note"},{"anchor":"Keychain-Access-Group","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Keychain Access Group"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If your app uses extensions (e.g., a Wallet Extension for background provisioning), configure a shared keychain access group:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keychain Sharing"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in your app target’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Signing & Capabilities","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the same access group to both the app and the extension."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the access group identifier when configuring the SDK:"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"code":["let parameters = ConfigurationParameters(","    appCertificate: certificate,","    paymentInstrumentIds: [paymentInstrumentId],","    keychainAccessGroup: \"[TeamId].com.yourcompany.shared\",","    environment: .live",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Wallet-Extension-Support","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Wallet Extension Support"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your app includes a Wallet Extension for provisioning cards in the background, the extension target requires the following frameworks with "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Embed & Sign"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the extension, use the same imports:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"]},{"anchor":"Verify-the-Integration","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Verify the Integration"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After embedding:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Build the project. All three frameworks should compile and link without errors.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Run on the iOS Simulator to verify basic initialization."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Test provisioning on a physical device (simulators do not support Apple Wallet)."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"text":"Troubleshooting","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Troubleshooting"},{"text":"“No such module ‘CardProvisioningSessions’” or “No such module ‘CardSessions’”","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"No-such-module-CardProvisioningSessions-or-No-such-module-CardSessions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure the XCFramework is added to your target’s "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" section and is set to "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"No-such-module-IssuingCommon","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"“No such module ‘IssuingCommon’”"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as above — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"},{"text":" must also be embedded. This framework contains shared types like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Runtime crash: “Library not loaded: IssuingCore”","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Runtime-crash-Library-not-loaded-IssuingCore"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" is not embedded. Add it to "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}]},{"text":" even though you don’t import it in code. The other frameworks depend on it at runtime.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Runtime-crash-Library-not-loaded-AdyenCardReveal","text":"Runtime crash: “Library not loaded: AdyenCardReveal”"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenCardReveal.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" is not embedded. It is a required dependency for Card Sessions (PAN\/PIN reveal). Add it to "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Duplicate symbols","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Duplicate-symbols"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you see duplicate symbol errors, ensure you are not linking both the SPM package and the manual XCFrameworks in the same target. Use one integration method, not both."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs/documentation/IssuingSDKDocs":{"title":"IssuingSDKDocs","role":"collection","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs","kind":"symbol"}}}